  "description": "TR stands for trail, but it could also mean ‘total ripper’. The Raft TR full suspension MTB is Ridleys way of doing a 120mm travel downcountry bike. Performance tuned suspension combined with a geometry that strikes a perfect balance between agile and stable. Confidence inspiring when needed while allowing you to get loose and wild where possible. With the slack 66.6 degree head angle and long wheelbase you are always in control. The Raft TR has a lightweight carbon fiber frame that has mounting points for 2 bottle cages inside the front triangle. Other mounting points allow you to carry tools or other accessories such as a top tube pack on the bike.",
